      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧接着下一刻，舞台上出现了大海。\n这时灯光一口气全开，同时海浪声响起，\n为空荡荡的舞台创造出了新世界──",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b5d4ad90fe72c15f53faa21a99291bb382f788a89d4d415abbc0f173cdff59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
