      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗨，这场表演很棒吧？\n这次的舞台效果如精雕细琢的宝石般完美──\n让我耀眼的魅力变得更加突出了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5efc77178cf2f684c2a754fdc758d165d54f49a37c6bf172a268c9abaa47053b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
